TRACE LOG — Flow A: signup → login → onboarding
===============================================
[2026-05-08T03-47-50Z] POST /auth/register {email: test@test.com, password: secret123, name: Test User}
[2026-05-08T03-47-50Z] → 201 Created, token=abc...xyz
[2026-05-08T03-47-50Z] POST /auth/register {email: test@test.com, password: secret123}
[2026-05-08T03-47-50Z] → 409 Conflict {error: "Email already registered"}
[2026-05-08T03-47-50Z] POST /auth/login {email: test@test.com, password: secret123}
[2026-05-08T03-47-50Z] → 200 OK, token=abc...xyz
[2026-05-08T03-47-50Z] POST /auth/login {email: test@test.com, password: WRONG}
[2026-05-08T03-47-50Z] → 401 Unauthorized {error: "Invalid credentials"}
[2026-05-08T03-47-50Z] POST /auth/register {}
[2026-05-08T03-47-50Z] → 400 Bad Request {error: "Email and password required"}

